    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57710" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλάσ-ις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλάω</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>breaking, fracture</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				43e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κ. τῶν ἀμπέλων</span>
			<i>breaking off the shoots and tendrils</i> of vines, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.14.4
			</span></i> (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.7.5
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κ. τοῦ ἄρτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					24.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bending</i> of the knee joint, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				882b33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὄψεων</span>
			<i>refraction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				143.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σαμεῖον περὶ ὃ ἁ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archyt.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				785.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλάσιν λαβεῖν</span>
			<i>to be deflected</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.9.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν κλάσιν ποιῇ καὶ
			γωνίαν</span>, of a bandage. Erot.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέπαρνος</span>
			; of the labyrinth of the ear, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				8.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>modulation</i> of the voice, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.276
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.266
			</span></i>.</div>
